    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Stillness is a breathtaking psychological horror game based on the story of Backrooms. You will be able to visit super realistic levels in which you will need to solve puzzles. But don't forget that you won't be there alone.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Famous Backrooms levels that we plan to implement:</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>-Fun level</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/26e1f94d2ccc807932f8822c18308cc0.poster.avif?t=1748190598\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/26e1f94d2ccc807932f8822c18308cc0.webm?t=1748190598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/26e1f94d2ccc807932f8822c18308cc0.mp4?t=1748190598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Personal Backrooms Levels:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>- Water caves</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/365f58da1c793fb4acf23b27a4d79ee7.poster.avif?t=1748190598\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/365f58da1c793fb4acf23b27a4d79ee7.webm?t=1748190598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/365f58da1c793fb4acf23b27a4d79ee7.mp4?t=1748190598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>- Children's town</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/25c6e60e64ea856651979e1a3c3d1976.poster.avif?t=1748190598\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/25c6e60e64ea856651979e1a3c3d1976.webm?t=1748190598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/25c6e60e64ea856651979e1a3c3d1976.mp4?t=1748190598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Puzzles, entities, and superbly detailed levels.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>This is the main difference between Stillness and other games in the Backrooms genre</i></u></p>",
