 autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/25c6e60e64ea856651979e1a3c3d1976.poster.avif?t=1748190598\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/25c6e60e64ea856651979e1a3c3d1976.webm?t=1748190598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546120/extras/25c6e60e64ea856651979e1a3c3d1976.mp4?t=1748190598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Puzzles, entities, and superbly detailed levels.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>This is the main difference between Stillness and other games in the Backrooms genre</i></u></p>",
